      Data: Levi3
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: If she's okay, she probably doesn't want to see me right now. And if
        she's not okay, well, I'd probably pass out and then we'd both need rescuing...
        Think you could go look for her and bring her back?
